      "fixedIn": null,
      "reason": "Permanent deprecation notice with no fix, reported under Module Results only. The single import from this module is golang.org/x/crypto/argon2 (veil-console internal/auth/auth.go); go list -deps confirms only argon2 and blake2b compile in. Go 1.26 ships no Argon2 in the standard library, so replacing the password hash to silence an unreachable advisory would be a net security loss."
